{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_40718","headline":"赠庞链师 · 李洞","name":"赠庞链师","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"家住涪江汉语娇，一声歌戛玉楼箫。\n睡融春日柔金缕，妆发秋霞战翠翘。\n两脸酒醺红杏妬，半胸酥嫩白云饶。\n若能携手随仙令，皎皎银河渡鹊桥。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李洞","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_40718.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_40718","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}